   "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>City image sketch map and interview (Lynch 1960)</title>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"sp-scheme\">\n{\"format\":\"sp-scheme-package\",\"spScheme\":\"2.0\",\"survey\":{\"title\":\"City image sketch map and interview (Lynch 1960)\",\"description\":\"Kevin Lynch's city-image interview: what first comes to mind about your city, a quick sketch map drawn from memory, your usual trip described step by step, and the elements you find most distinctive.\",\"locale\":\"en\",\"pages\":[\n{\"name\":\"intro\",\"elements\":[{\"type\":\"boolean\",\"name\":\"consent\",\"title\":\"I agree to take part. My answers are recorded anonymously for research.\",\"isRequired\":true}]},\n{\"name\":\"you\",\"elements\":[\n{\"type\":\"text\",\"name\":\"city\",\"title\":\"Which city will you describe? (the city you live or work in)\",\"isRequired\":true},\n{\"type\":\"text\",\"name\":\"years_in_city\",\"title\":\"For how many years have you lived or worked there?\",\"isRequired\":true,\"inputType\":\"number\",\"min\":0,\"max\":100},\n{\"type\":\"radiogroup\",\"name\":\"design_training\",\"title\":\"Are you an architect, city planner, engineer or otherwise trained in drawing maps or buildings?\",\"isRequired\":true,\"description\":\"Lynch excluded such respondents; keep them apart in the analysis.\",\"choices\":[{\"value\":\"no\",\"text\":\"No\"},{\"value\":\"yes\",\"text\":\"Yes\"}]}]},\n{\"name\":\"symbols\",\"elements\":[\n{\"type\":\"comment\",\"name\":\"first_mind\",\"title\":\"What first comes to your mind when I say the name of your city? What are its physical symbols or generalized pictures for you?\",\"isRequired\":true,\"description\":\"Interview section 3.\"},\n{\"type\":\"comment\",\"name\":\"physical_character\",\"title\":\"Are there any physical characteristics you associate with your city, such as materials, colours, textures, kinds of buildings, kinds of streets, crowdedness, smells, noises, cleanliness, age? Tell me the ones you think are most important.\",\"isRequired\":false,\"description\":\"Interview section 3b.\"}]},\n{\"name\":\"map\",\"elements\":[\n{\"type\":\"custom\",\"name\":\"sketch_map\",\"title\":\"Please make a quick map of your city, as if you were making a rapid description of the city for a stranger. Not an accurate drawing, just a rough sketch.\",\"isRequired\":true,\"description\":\"Interview section 4. Value: {w, h, seconds, strokes:[{t, p:[x,y,x,y,…]}], labels:[{t, x, y, s}]}. Strokes and name labels are stored in the order they were made (t = seconds since the map was started), because Lynch noted the sequence in which elements were drawn; coordinates are pixels on a w × h sheet. Time limit in the original: 15 minutes (seconds shows the time actually used). Analysis as in Lynch: classify what was drawn and named into paths, edges, districts, nodes and landmarks and count how many respondents include each element.\"},\n{\"type\":\"radiogroup\",\"name\":\"north\",\"title\":\"Would you show me on your map the direction of north?\",\"isRequired\":true,\"description\":\"Interview section 8. Value: direction on the sheet that the participant believes is north.\",\"choices\":[{\"value\":\"up\",\"text\":\"Up\"},{\"value\":\"up_right\",\"text\":\"Up-right\"},{\"value\":\"right\",\"text\":\"Right\"},{\"value\":\"down_right\",\"text\":\"Down-right\"},{\"value\":\"down\",\"text\":\"Down\"},{\"value\":\"down_left\",\"text\":\"Down-left\"},{\"value\":\"left\",\"text\":\"Left\"},{\"value\":\"up_left\",\"text\":\"Up-left\"},{\"value\":\"unknown\",\"text\":\"I don't know\"}]}]},\n{\"name\":\"trip\",\"elements\":[\n{\"type\":\"comment\",\"name\":\"usual_trip\",\"title\":\"Please give complete directions for your usual trip from home to work (or to the place you go most often). Picture yourself actually making the trip, and describe all the familiar things you see, hear and smell along the way, including those that would give a stranger the clues he needs to make the decisions you have to make.\",\"isRequired\":true,\"description\":\"Interview section 5.\"},\n{\"type\":\"comment\",\"name\":\"trip_feelings\",\"title\":\"Do you have any particular feelings about various parts of your trip?\",\"isRequired\":false,\"description\":\"Interview section 5a.\"},\n{\"type\":\"text\",\"name\":\"trip_length\",\"title\":\"How long do you think this trip is? (distance or time, as you prefer)\",\"isRequired\":true,\"description\":\"Interview section 5b. Free text, as Lynch left the unit to the respondent.\"}]},\n{\"name\":\"elements\",\"elements\":[\n{\"type\":\"comment\",\"name\":\"distinctive_elements\",\"title\":\"What particular physical elements of your city do you think are most distinctive or vivid? They may be very large or small, but they should be easy to remember or identify any time you are in, near, or on them: streets, large city areas, open spaces, buildings, details, or other sorts of things. Name them quickly, one per line.\",\"isRequired\":true,\"description\":\"Interview section 7.\"},\n{\"type\":\"comment\",\"name\":\"describe_element_1\",\"title\":\"Take the first element you named. Describe it so that I can be sure that, taken there blindfolded, you would immediately know where you were when the blindfold was removed.\",\"isRequired\":true,\"description\":\"Interview section 7a.\"},\n{\"type\":\"comment\",\"name\":\"describe_element_2\",\"title\":\"Now describe a second element from your list in the same way.\",\"isRequired\":false,\"description\":\"Interview section 7b.\"},\n{\"type\":\"comment\",\"name\":\"describe_element_3\",\"title\":\"And a third element from your list.\",\"isRequired\":false,\"description\":\"Interview section 7c.\"}]},\n{\"name\":\"closing\",\"elements\":[\n{\"type\":\"radiogroup\",\"name\":\"wayfinding\",\"title\":\"Do you find your city easy or difficult to find your way in, or to distinguish one part from another?\",\"isRequired\":true,\"description\":\"Interview section 9d.\",\"choices\":[{\"value\":1,\"text\":\"Very difficult\"},{\"value\":2,\"text\":\"Rather difficult\"},{\"value\":3,\"text\":\"Neither\"},{\"value\":4,\"text\":\"Rather easy\"},{\"value\":5,\"text\":\"Very easy\"}]},\n{\"type\":\"comment\",\"name\":\"wayfinding_why\",\"title\":\"Why?\",\"isRequired\":false},\n{\"type\":\"radiogroup\",\"name\":\"gender\",\"title\":\"Your gender\",\"isRequired\":true,\"choices\":[{\"value\":\"female\",\"text\":\"Female\"},{\"value\":\"male\",\"text\":\"Male\"},{\"value\":\"other\",\"text\":\"Other / prefer not to say\"}]},\n{\"type\":\"radiogroup\",\"name\":\"age\",\"title\":\"Your age\",\"isRequired\":true,\"choices\":[{\"value\":1,\"text\":\"Under 18\"},{\"value\":2,\"text\":\"18–24\"},{\"value\":3,\"text\":\"25–39\"},{\"value\":4,\"text\":\"40–59\"},{\"value\":5,\"text\":\"60 or older\"}]}]}]}}\n</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#f2f1ed;--card:#fff;--ink:#1d1e21;--muted:#5d6066;--accent:#8a2f2a;--accent-ink:#fff;--line:#d9d6cf;--warn:#b3261e}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:920px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 16px 40px}h1{font-size:1.3rem;margin:0 0 8px}p{margin:0 0 10px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink)}.btn:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}\n.btn.ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--accent);border:1px solid var(--accent)}.btn.sm{padding:7px 12px;font-size:.9rem}.btn.sel{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border-color:var(--ink)}\n.row{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:14px;align-items:center}\n.q{margin-top:16px}.q>b{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-weight:600}\ntextarea,input[type=text],input[type=number]{width:100%;font:inherit;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}\ntextarea{min-height:110px;resize:vertical}input[type=number]{width:140px}\nlabel.o{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer}\n.step{display:inline-block;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#f0e2e0;color:#6b2420;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px}\n.sheet{position:relative;border:1px solid #bdb9b0;background:#fffdf8;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;touch-action:none}\n.sheet canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;cursor:crosshair;user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none}\n.sheet input{position:absolute;width:150px;padding:3px 6px;font-size:.85rem;border:1px solid var(--accent);border-radius:6px;z-index:2}\n.tools{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;margin:8px 0}\n.clock{margin-left:auto;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}\n.compass{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,56px);gap:6px;margin-top:8px}\n.compass button{height:44px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:8px;font-size:1.2rem;cursor:pointer}.compass button.sel{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:var(--accent)}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.credit{max-width:920px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Method: Lynch, K. (1960). <i>The Image of the City</i>. Cambridge, MA: MIT Press. Question wording follows the project's own interview guide, \"Explanation of City-Form Interview Procedure\" (Perceptual Form of the City project, MIT, 1956; MIT Libraries, Dome, handle 1721.3/35618).</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'),A={};\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.textContent=m||'';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function has(n){var v=A[n];return v!=null&&v!=='';}\n  function T(n){var t=SPSite.getQuestion(n).title;return A.city?t.replace(/the name of your city/g,'\"'+A.city+'\"').replace(/your city/g,A.city):t;}\n  var PAGES=[\n    {step:'About you',names:['city','years_in_city','design_training']},\n    {step:'Part 1 of 5 · first impressions',names:['first_mind','physical_character']},\n    {step:'Part 2 of 5 · your map',map:true},\n    {step:'Part 3 of 5 · your usual trip',names:['usual_trip','trip_feelings','trip_length']},\n    {step:'Part 4 of 5 · distinctive elements',names:['distinctive_elements','describe_element_1','describe_element_2','describe_element_3']},\n    {step:'Part 5 of 5 · finding your way',names:['wayfinding','wayfinding_why','gender','age']}];\n  var OPT={physical_character:1,trip_feelings:1,describe_element_2:1,describe_element_3:1,wayfinding_why:1};\n  function req(n){return !OPT[n];}\n  function next(){window.scrollTo(0,0);\n    if(A.consent!==true)return intro();\n    for(var i=0;i<PAGES.length;i++){var P=PAGES[i];\n      if(P.map){if(!has('sketch_map')||!has('north'))return mapPage(P);continue;}\n      for(var k=0;k<P.names.length;k++)if(req(P.names[k])&&!has(P.names[k]))return form(P);}\n    finish();}\n  function intro(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>How do you picture your city?</h1><p>This is a short version of the interview that Kevin Lynch used for <i>The Image of the City</i>. You will be asked what comes to mind when you think of your city, to draw a quick map of it from memory, to describe a trip you make often, and to name the places you find most distinctive.</p><p>Please do not look at a real map. Nobody finds the drawing easy, and only a quick rough sketch is expected. It takes about 20 minutes and works best on a computer or tablet.</p><div class=\"card\"><p>'+esc(SPSite.getQuestion('consent').title)+'</p><div class=\"row\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"yes\">I agree</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('yes').onclick=function(){var b=this;b.disabled=true;SPSite.answer('consent',true).then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){b.disabled=false;return err(r.error);}A.consent=true;next();});};}\n  function form(P){\n    var h='<div class=\"card\"><span class=\"step\">'+esc(P.step)+'</span>';\n    P.names.forEach(function(n){var q=SPSite.getQuestion(n);h+='<div class=\"q\"><b>'+esc(T(n))+(req(n)?'':' <span style=\"font-weight:400;color:#777\">(optional)</span>')+'</b>';\n      if(q.type==='radiogroup')h+=q.choices.map(function(c){return '<label class=\"o\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+n+'\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('');\n      else if(q.type==='comment')h+='<textarea id=\"f_'+n+'\"></textarea>';\n      else h+='<input id=\"f_'+n+'\" type=\"'+(q.inputType==='number'?'number':'text')+'\"'+(q.inputType==='number'?' min=\"0\" max=\"100\"':'')+'>';\n      h+='</div>';});\n    app.innerHTML=h+'<div class=\"row\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Continue</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){var v={};\n      for(var k=0;k<P.names.length;k++){var n=P.names[k],q=SPSite.getQuestion(n),x;\n        if(q.type==='radiogroup'){var c=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+n+'\"]:checked');x=c?c.value:'';if(x!==''&&typeof q.choices[0].value==='number')x=Number(x);}\n        else{x=document.getElementById('f_'+n).value.trim();if(q.inputType==='number'&&x!==''){x=Number(x);if(isNaN(x)||x<0||x>100)return err('Please enter a number of years.');}}\n        if(req(n)&&x==='')return err('Please answer: '+T(n).slice(0,80)+(T(n).length>80?'…':''));\n        if(x!=='')v[n]=x;}\n      var b=this,ks=Object.keys(v);b.disabled=true;\n      Promise.all(ks.map(function(n){return SPSite.answer(n,v[n]);})).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}ks.forEach(function(n){A[n]=v[n];});\n        next();});};}\n  function mapPage(P){\n    var narrow=window.innerWidth<700,W=narrow?640:1100,H=narrow?640:680,strokes=[],labels=[],mode='draw',t0=null,north=A.north||null,cur=null,tick=null;\n    app.innerHTML='<div class=\"card\"><span class=\"step\">'+esc(P.step)+'</span><h1>'+esc(T('sketch_map'))+'</h1><p>Draw with your finger, pen or mouse. Use <b>Add a name</b> and tap the sheet to write a name on the map. You have about 15 minutes; put down what matters most first.</p><div class=\"tools\"><button class=\"btn sm ghost sel\" id=\"mDraw\">Draw</button><button class=\"btn sm ghost\" id=\"mName\">Add a name</button><button class=\"btn sm ghost\" id=\"undo\">Undo</button><span class=\"clock\" id=\"clk\">0:00 of 15:00</span></div><div class=\"sheet\" id=\"sheet\"><canvas id=\"cv\" width=\"'+W+'\" height=\"'+H+'\"></canvas></div><div class=\"q\"><b>'+esc(SPSite.getQuestion('north').title)+'</b><div class=\"compass\" id=\"cmp\"></div><div class=\"row\" style=\"margin-top:8px\"><button class=\"btn sm ghost\" id=\"nUnk\">I don\\'t know</button></div></div><div class=\"row\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">My map is finished</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    var cv=document.getElementById('cv'),cx=cv.getContext('2d'),sheet=document.getElementById('sheet'),clk=document.getElementById('clk');\n    var DIRS=[['up_left','↖'],['up','↑'],['up_right','↗'],['left','←'],[null,'N?'],['right','→'],['down_left','↙'],['down','↓'],['down_right','↘']];\n    var cmp=document.getElementById('cmp');cmp.innerHTML=DIRS.map(function(d){return d[0]?'<button type=\"button\" data-d=\"'+d[0]+'\" aria-label=\"North is '+d[0].replace('_','-')+'\">'+d[1]+'</button>':'<span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#888;font-size:.8rem\">north</span>';}).join('');\n    function paintN(){cmp.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(function(b){b.classList.toggle('sel',b.getAttribute('data-d')===north);});document.getElementById('nUnk').classList.toggle('sel',north==='unknown');}\n    cmp.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(function(b){b.onclick=function(){north=b.getAttribute('data-d');paintN();};});document.getElementById('nUnk').onclick=function(){north='unknown';paintN();};paintN();\n    function now(){if(t0==null){t0=Date.now();tick=setInterval(function(){if(!document.body.contains(clk))return clearInterval(tick);var s=Math.floor((Date.now()-t0)/1000);clk.textContent=Math.floor(s/60)+':'+('0'+s%60).slice(-2)+' of 15:00'+(s>=900?' · time is up, please finish':'');},1000);}return Math.round((Date.now()-t0)/100)/10;}\n    function redraw(){cx.clearRect(0,0,W,H);cx.lineWidth=2.5;cx.lineCap='round';cx.lineJoin='round';cx.strokeStyle='#111';\n      strokes.forEach(function(s){cx.beginPath();cx.moveTo(s.p[0],s.p[1]);for(var i=2;i<s.p.length;i+=2)cx.lineTo(s.p[i],s.p[i+1]);if(s.p.length===2)cx.lineTo(s.p[0]+.1,s.p[1]+.1);cx.stroke();});\n      cx.font='600 18px system-ui,sans-serif';cx.fillStyle='#8a2f2a';labels.forEach(function(l){cx.fillText(l.s,l.x,l.y);});}\n    function pt(e){var r=cv.getBoundingClientRect();return [Math.round((e.clientX-r.left)/r.width*W),Math.round((e.clientY-r.top)/r.height*H)];}\n    function setMode(m){mode=m;document.getElementById('mDraw').classList.toggle('sel',m==='draw');document.getElementById('mName').classList.toggle('sel',m==='name');}\n    document.getElementById('mDraw').onclick=function(){setMode('draw');};document.getElementById('mName').onclick=function(){setMode('name');};\n    document.getElementById('undo').onclick=function(){var ls=labels.length?labels[labels.length-1].t:-1,ss=strokes.length?strokes[strokes.length-1].t:-1;if(ls<0&&ss<0)return;if(ls>ss)labels.pop();else strokes.pop();redraw();};\n    cv.addEventListener('click',function(e){if(mode!=='name')return;var p=pt(e),old=sheet.querySelector('input');if(old)old.blur();\n      var r=cv.getBoundingClientRect(),inp=document.createElement('input');inp.type='text';inp.maxLength=40;inp.placeholder='name, then Enter';\n      inp.style.left=Math.min(r.width-155,Math.max(0,e.clientX-r.left))+'px';inp.style.top=Math.min(r.height-30,Math.max(0,e.clientY-r.top-14))+'px';sheet.appendChild(inp);inp.focus();\n      var done=false;function commit(){if(done)return;done=true;var s=inp.value.trim();inp.remove();if(s){labels.push({t:now(),x:p[0],y:p[1],s:s});redraw();}}\n      inp.addEventListener('keydown',function(k){if(k.key==='Enter'){k.preventDefault();commit();}});inp.addEventListener('blur',commit);});\n    cv.addEventListener('pointerdown',function(e){if(mode==='name')return;e.preventDefault();var p=pt(e);\n      cv.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);cur={t:now(),p:[p[0],p[1]]};strokes.push(cur);redraw();});\n    cv.addEventListener('pointermove',function(e){if(!cur)return;var p=pt(e),n=cur.p.length,dx=p[0]-cur.p[n-2],dy=p[1]-cur.p[n-1];if(dx*dx+dy*dy<16)return;cur.p.push(p[0],p[1]);redraw();});\n    function up(){cur=null;}cv.addEventListener('pointerup',up);cv.addEventListener('pointercancel',up);\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){var open=sheet.querySelector('input');if(open)open.blur();\n      var len=strokes.reduce(function(a,s){return a+s.p.length/2;},0);\n      if(strokes.length<3||len<30)return err('Please draw your map first. A rough sketch is enough.');\n      if(!north)return err('Please show which way north is on your map, or choose \"I don\\'t know\".');\n      var b=this,val={w:W,h:H,seconds:now(),strokes:strokes,labels:labels};b.disabled=true;\n      SPSite.answer('sketch_map',val).then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){b.disabled=false;return err(r.error);}A.sketch_map=val;return SPSite.answer('north',north).then(function(r2){if(!ok(r2)){b.disabled=false;return err(r2.error);}A.north=north;clearInterval(tick);next();});});};}\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p>Kevin Lynch and his colleagues at MIT gave this interview in the 1950s to residents of Boston, Jersey City and Los Angeles. By laying the sketch maps and descriptions over one another, he found that people build their picture of a city from five kinds of elements: <b>paths</b> they move along, <b>edges</b> such as rivers and walls, <b>districts</b> with a common character, <b>nodes</b> such as squares and junctions, and <b>landmarks</b> seen from outside.</p><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');return;}var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers have been saved. You can close this window now.';});}\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){A=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};next();});\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
